    <system:String x:Key="HelpTopicWhatsNewSubtitle">Overview of recent improvements and new features in Sources System</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="HelpWhatsNewLeadText">We continuously improve Sources System to provide top-tier performance, reliability, physical precision, and security.</system:String>
