    <system:String x:Key="HelpWhatsNew2Desc">Interactive decay and radiation dose rate computation tool connected to the central decay engine with full unit conversions and forward/backward calculations.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="HelpWhatsNew3Title">Refreshed User &amp; Permission Management UI</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="HelpWhatsNew3Desc">Modern user management interface with granular section permissions, security cards, and failed-login monitors.</system:String>
